rial":"spines","role":"body","tone":0.85,"p0":[0.01337,-0.00414,-0.042],"p1":[0.035,0,-0.042],"r0":0.0055,"r1":0.005,"member":"hind-n","part":"member"},{"id":"member-hind-f","kind":"capsule","bone":"hind-f","material":"spines","role":"body","tone":0.85,"p0":[0.01153,0.00794,0.042],"p1":[0.035,0,0.042],"r0":0.0055,"r1":0.005,"member":"hind-f","part":"member"},{"id":"member-forepaw-n","kind":"capsule","bone":"forepaw-n","material":"spines","role":"body","tone":0.85,"p0":[0.00236,0.00019,-0.035],"p1":[0.03232,0.00313,-0.035],"r0":0.0045,"r1":0.0045,"member":"forepaw-n","part":"member"},{"id":"member-forepaw-f","kind":"capsule","bone":"forepaw-f","material":"spines","role":"body","tone":0.85,"p0":[0.02623,-0.01819,0.035],"p1":[0.03459,0.01073,0.035],"r0":0.0045,"r1":0.0045,"member":"forepaw-f","part":"member"},{"id":"member-hindpaw-n","kind":"capsule","bone":"hindpaw-n","material":"spines","role":"body","tone":0.85,"p0":[0.03793,-0.01532,-0.042],"p1":[0.03505,0.01816,-0.042],"r0":0.0045,"r1":0.0045,"member":"hindpaw-n","part":"member"},{"id":"member-hindpaw-f","kind":"capsule","bone":"hindpaw-f","material":"spines","role":"body","tone":0.85,"p0":[0.01742,0.00212,0.042],"p1":[-2e-05,0.00646,0.042],"r0":0.0045,"r1":0.0045,"member":"hindpaw-f","part":"member"},{"id":"joint-fore-n","kind":"ellipsoid","bone":"fore-n","material":"spines","role":"detail","tone":0.35,"radii":[0.0085,0.0085,0.0085],"transform":{"translation":[0,0,-0.035]},"member":"fore-n","part":"joint"},{"id":"joint-fore-f","kind":"ellipsoid","bone":"fore-f","material":"spines","role":"detail","tone":0.35,"radii":[0.0085,0.0085,0.0085],"transform":{"translation":[0,0,0.035]},"member":"fore-f","part":"joint"},{"id":"joint-hind-n","kind":"ellipsoid","bone":"hind-n","material":"spines","role":"detail","tone":0.35,"radii":[0.0085,0.0085,0.0085],"transform":{"translation":[0.01337,-0.00414,-0.042]},"member":"hind-n","part":"joint"},{"id":"joint-hind-f","kind":"ellipsoid","bone":"hind-f","material":"spines","role":"detail","tone":0.35,"radii":[0.0085,0.0085,0.0085],"transform":{"translation":[0.01153,0.00794,0.042]},"member":"hind-f","part":"joint"}],"decisions":[{"en":"Body at 1:50 (smallest feature 7.5 mm), built from this scale's own drawings: the spine dome is one loft whose depth follows the drawn dome outline and whose width follows the plan dome, the four spine skirts (rear and front, near and far) are lofts over their own outlines (the elevation skirts were drawn as unfilled jagged outlines and were filled at the root), a separate belly loft of fur lies under the dome, the neck follows its inclined bone and the head is a loft that ends in a protruding nose. The legs are stubs on their real bones: a capsule for fore and hind limb and a flat paw ellipsoid standing on the drawn ground line (the rig pose floats some paws, so the stubs were clamped to the ground line and the drawn belly).","de":"Körper bei 1:50 (kleinstes Merkmal 7,5 mm), aus den eigenen Zeichnungen dieses Maßstabs: Die Stachelkuppel ist ein Loft, dessen Tiefe dem gezeichneten Kuppelumriss und dessen Breite der Kuppel der Draufsicht folgt, die vier Stachelröcke (hinten und vorn, nah und fern) sind Lofts über ihre eigenen Umrisse (die Röcke der Ansicht waren als ungefüllte gezackte Umrisse gezeichnet und wurden an der Wurzel gefüllt), ein eigener Bauch-Loft aus Fell liegt unter der Kuppel, der Hals folgt seiner geneigten Bone und der Kopf ist ein Loft mit vorstehender Nase. Die Beine sind Stummel auf ihren wirklichen Bones: eine Kapsel je Vorder- und Hinterbein und eine flache Pfotenellipse auf der gezeichneten Bodenlinie (die Pose des Rigs lässt einige Pfoten schweben, daher wurden die Stummel auf die Bodenlinie und den gezeichneten Bauch begrenzt)."},{"en":"Thermal: every region is bound to this scale's solids by reference (spines on the dome and skirts, belly fur on the belly, face fur on neck and head, limb fur on the leg capsules, skin on the paws and the nose); spine, fur and coat regions are exchange areas (coverage only), the nose and paws are physiological skin areas compared at 30 %. The plume is a thin horizontal disc on the dome and the nose jet a short capsule.","de":"Thermik: Jede Region ist per Referenz an die Körper dieses Maßstabs gebunden (Stacheln an Kuppel und Röcken, Bauchfell am Bauch, Gesichtsfell an Hals und Kopf, Beinfell an den Beinkapseln, Haut an Pfoten und Nase); Stachel-, Fell- und Haarregionen sind Austauschflächen (nur Abdeckung), Nase und Pfoten sind physiologische Hautflächen mit 30 % Toleranz. Die Fahne ist eine flache liegende Scheibe auf der Kuppel, der Nasenstrahl eine kurze Kapsel."},{"en":"Structure: trunk, skirt, neck and head members are the cores of their masses, each leg bone is a thin shaft on the same line as its body stub, four ball joints sit at the limb roots, one mass solid stands for the trunk; members lie inside the silhouette.","de":"Tragwerk: Rumpf-, Rock-, Hals- und Kopfglieder sind die Kerne ihrer Massen, jeder Beinknochen ist ein dünner Schaft auf derselben Linie wie sein Körperstummel, vier Kugelgelenke sitzen an den Beinwurzeln, ein Massekörper steht für den Rumpf; die Glieder liegen innerhalb der Silhouette."}]},"100":{"status":"authored","denominator":100,"body":[{"id":"dome","kind":"loft","bone":"trunk","material":"spines","role":"body","tone":0.4,"sections":[{"at":[-0.034,0.00858,0],"rx":0.01898,"ry":0.01436,"exponent":2.2,"rotation":[0,-0.70711,0,0.70711]},{"at":[-0.00671,0.00067,0],"rx":0.05811,"ry":0.04587,"exponent":2.2,"rotation":[0,-0.70711,0,0.70711]},{"at":[0.02057,-0.00034,0],"rx":0.07007,"ry":0.05679,"exponent":2.2,"rotation":[0,-0.70711,0,0.70711]},{"at":[0.04786,0.00037,0],"rx":0.07295,"ry":0.06154,"exponent":2.2,"rotation":[0,-0.70711,0,0.70711]},{"at":[0.07514,0.00084,0],"rx":0.07465,"ry":0.06298,"exponent":2.2,"rotation":[0,-0.70711,0,0.70711]},{"at":[0.10243,0.00047,0],"rx":0.07198,"ry":0.06016,"exponent":2.2,"rotation":[0,-0.70711,0,0.70711]},{"at":[0.12971,-0.00189,0],"rx":0.05813,"ry":0.0